I AM ALWAYS THE HOSTESS.

483
00:20:07,165 --> 00:20:08,124
HEY.

484
00:20:08,166 --> 00:20:09,249
HOW DID IT GO?

485
00:20:09,291 --> 00:20:11,044
WELL, SHE WASN'T
SLEEPING WITH HIM.

486
00:20:11,085 --> 00:20:12,045
OH, GOOD.

487
00:20:12,086 --> 00:20:13,504
SHE IS NOW.

488
00:20:16,174 --> 00:20:17,466
WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?

489
00:20:17,508 --> 00:20:20,970
I'M SAYING THAT
SHE IS A DEVIL WOMAN.

490
00:20:21,012 --> 00:20:23,681
YOU KNOW, I MEAN,
YOU THINK YOU KNOW A PERSON.

491
00:20:23,723 --> 00:20:26,225
THEN THEY TURN AROUND,
THEY SLEEP WITH NICK.

492
00:20:26,266 --> 00:20:29,729
NICK AND HIS ROCK-HARD PECS
AND HIS GIANT MAN NIPPLES.

493
00:20:31,981 --> 00:20:35,068
I HATE HIM...
AND I HATE HER.

494
00:20:35,109 --> 00:20:37,904
WELL, I DON'T HATE HER.
I LOVE HER.

495
00:20:37,945 --> 00:20:39,655
THIS IS ALL MY FAULT, REALLY.

496
00:20:39,697 --> 00:20:41,741
HOW? HOW IS IT
YOUR FAULT?

497
00:20:41,782 --> 00:20:45,244
BECAUSE... AAH! I...
I SHOULD HAVE CALLED.

498
00:20:45,285 --> 00:20:46,954
YOU KNOW, IF I HAD JUST
CALLED HER

499
00:20:46,996 --> 00:20:48,372
AFTER OUR BIG, STUPID FIGHT

500
00:20:48,414 --> 00:20:50,374
SHE NEVER WOULD HAVE
GONE OUT WITH NICK

501
00:20:50,416 --> 00:20:52,877
AND THEY WOULDN'T HAVE
ENDED UP IN BED TOGETHER.

502
00:20:52,919 --> 00:20:53,878
I THREW HER

503
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:55,671
AT HIS MAN NIPPLES.

504
00:20:55,713 --> 00:20:57,506
HONEY, THIS IS
NOT YOUR FAULT.

505
00:20:57,548 --> 00:20:59,425
JUST BECAUSE YOU
GUYS HAD A FIGHT

506
00:20:59,466 --> 00:21:01,969
DOES NOT JUSTIFY HER
SLEEPING WITH SOMEONE.

507
00:21:04,222 --> 00:21:07,474
WELL, IF-IF SHE THOUGHT
THEY WERE ON A BREAK...

508
00:21:14,941 --> 00:21:16,316
ONE OF YOUR CUSTOMERS SEEMS

509
00:21:16,358 --> 00:21:19,153
TO HAVE LEFT HIS BILLFOLD--
A JOSHUA BURGIN.

510
00:21:19,195 --> 00:21:20,446
REALLY?

511
00:21:20,487 --> 00:21:21,655
WILL YOU CALL HIM?

512
00:21:21,697 --> 00:21:24,658
YES. I WILL, ABSOLUTELY.

513
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:28,621
[Captioned by
The Caption Center
WGBH Educational Foundation]

514
00:21:38,131 --> 00:21:40,424
( in a deep voice ):
HELLO, RACHEL.

515
00:21:40,466 --> 00:21:42,342
HI, JOSHUA.

516
00:21:42,384 --> 00:21:44,887
I LEFT MY WALLET HERE
ON PURPOSE.

517
00:21:44,929 --> 00:21:46,639
REALLY?

518
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:49,016
YES. I JUST WANTED
TO SEE YOU AGAIN.

519
00:21:49,058 --> 00:21:51,685
OH, I'M GLAD.

520
00:21:51,727 --> 00:21:54,312
RACHEL, I'D LIKE
TO SAY SOMETHING TO YOU.

521
00:21:54,354 --> 00:21:56,523
YES?

522
00:21:56,565 --> 00:21:59,068
HOW YOU DOIN'?

